The bug was caused by the `lastQueryString` not being properly decoded, which could lead to issues when processing the query parameters in the `DummyLogStreamingServlet`. This improper handling of the query string likely resulted in the test `TestZKXLogStreamingService.testStreamingWithMultipleOozieServers_coordActionList` failing due to unexpected or malformed input.

Code statements information:
